This repository bundles third-party assets in crates/polterware-assets/assets:

- Hugeicons Free (stroke rounded), MIT License: icons/LICENSE-hugeicons.txt
- Inter, SIL Open Font License 1.1: fonts/Inter-OFL.txt
- JetBrains Mono, SIL Open Font License 1.1: fonts/JetBrainsMono-OFL.txt

The bot avatars come from bot-avatar (https://github.com/polterware/bot-avatar),
a Rust port of bot-avatars by Jakub Antalik (MIT License).

crates/polterware-mermaid is a Rust port of mermaid (https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid,
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2014 - 2022 Knut Sveidqvist) and of its layout engines dagre
(https://github.com/dagrejs/dagre) and graphlib (https://github.com/dagrejs/graphlib)
(MIT License, Copyright (c) 2012-2014 Chris Pettitt).
